{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EMOTIONLESS: The Last Ticket</strong>\u00a0is a first-person psychological horror experience focused on atmosphere and exploration. You are James Anderson, a son returning to the abandoned amusement park his missing father built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/560ddfe0f1d7d0d3017b324c486bd229.poster.avif?t=1766441185\" width=1170 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/560ddfe0f1d7d0d3017b324c486bd229.webm?t=1766441185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything you see is real, and not everyone you see is alive. Not everything in this world belongs to it. Venture into a surreal world inspired by liminal spaces and cosmic horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/9cfd7a6e23222d87702ec58e6fd9911b.poster.avif?t=1766441185\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/9cfd7a6e23222d87702ec58e6fd9911b.webm?t=1766441185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/9cfd7a6e23222d87702ec58e6fd9911b.mp4?t=1766441185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/f535d5ed1d605a965f753cc1943e3cb6.poster.avif?t=1766441185\" width=1170 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/f535d5ed1d605a965f753cc1943e3cb6.webm?t=1766441185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues, find audio logs and navigate a haunting narrative without immersion-breaking combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/6f67c3e93a2de2c2d094863836ccb6fa.poster.avif?t=1766441185\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/6f67c3e93a2de2c2d094863836ccb6fa.webm?t=1766441185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/6f67c3e93a2de2c2d094863836ccb6fa.mp4?t=1766441185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/51f7d27a80c6a8509ed0fe1be34476bc.poster.avif?t=1766441185\" width=1170 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/51f7d27a80c6a8509ed0fe1be34476bc.webm?t=1766441185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal activity or something ordinary seen from another plane of existence? Some events simply can\u2019t be explained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/c0d1603472150703f68701a7d45585c8.poster.avif?t=1766441185\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/c0d1603472150703f68701a7d45585c8.webm?t=1766441185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/c0d1603472150703f68701a7d45585c8.mp4?t=1766441185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/067bfead35e41260257f61ee314a9486.poster.avif?t=1766441185\" width=1170 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/067bfead35e41260257f61ee314a9486.webm?t=1766441185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost, find the right path, and then get lost again. Not every hallway in this twisted amusement park makes sense\u2026 Test your nerves and your sense of direction as paths change and corridors twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/3886ca03ad387a0592982401cd5c3932.poster.avif?t=1766441185\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/3886ca03ad387a0592982401cd5c3932.webm?t=1766441185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/a6b9f42f9235a2e7bb0e01e576f01b55.poster.avif?t=1766441185\" width=1170 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/a6b9f42f9235a2e7bb0e01e576f01b55.webm?t=1766441185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why not take a moment to experience the amusement park\u2019s attractions? Just don\u2019t get too relaxed, who knows what awaits on these one-of-a-kind rides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/ca4a6c84b5a407c2885f88c7c152ca5a.poster.avif?t=1766441185\" width=512 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/ca4a6c84b5a407c2885f88c7c152ca5a.webm?t=1766441185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3570000/5279cdef85e4f7c50ddee9ac191ab9502bee9801.jpg"},{"name":"Into Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3570000/084a3d78a6270cc5f47324f136ff293b8fe173dd.jpg"},{"name":"Let There Be Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap